  "visual_summary": "Modular isometric tile set for road, water, beach, hill, bridge, lot and tree placement. Each tile is rendered at a 3/4 axonometric angle on a rhombus footprint, with crisp 2-tone vector shading, no outlines, and chunky bevelled edges. Roads and parking lots use dark asphalt grey with white lane stripes; terrain tiles layer green grass, light blue water, and tan sand. Directional variants use N/S/E/W and NEx/NWx/ESx/SWx cardinal+suffix codes so tiles snap into continuous networks. Accent props (4 conifer and deciduous tree sprites) and 2 small bridges round out the kit for procedural or hand-built isometric maps.",
